[{"id":"addon:blighted_corruption:compound_thirty_three","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-21","title":"33号化合物","titleEn":"Compound Thirty-Three","rarity":"ultra","description":["塔尔伯特倒数第二次尝试的血清。尽管它没能促成他的逃脱，但确实有强大的副作用。","·横冲不能连续超过5次。","·横冲转向速率增加11%。","·横冲持续时间增加11%。"],"flavor":"“时间很宝贵。希望这次会有效……”——塔尔伯特·格莱姆斯","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_compoundThirtyThree.webp","glyph":0,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Compound_Thirty-Three","pinyin":"33haohuahewu","initials":"33hhhw"},{"id":"addon:blighted_corruption:iridescent_blight_tag","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-21","title":"荧虹枯萎者标签","titleEn":"Iridescent Blight Tag","rarity":"ultra","description":["由迷雾铸造出的玻璃状实验室标签。这要么是恶灵的礼物，要么只是对枯萎者开的恶意贴标签玩笑，就像他曾对别人做的那样。","·横冲不能连续超过3次。","·横冲时最大观察角度增加20度。","·横冲速度增加10%。"],"flavor":"“进步需要彻底性的改变。”——塔尔伯特·格莱姆斯","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_iridescentBlightTag.webp","glyph":1,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Iridescent_Blight_Tag","pinyin":"yinghongkuweizhebiaoqian","initials":"yhkwzbq"},{"id":"addon:blighted_corruption:summoning_stone","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-21","title":"召唤石","titleEn":"Summoning Stone","rarity":"very-rare","description":["塔尔伯特用这块石头将自己认为的研究成果刻在了鸦片馆的墙上。","·首次横冲持续时间延长0.5秒。"],"flavor":"“死亡仅仅是个开始。”","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_summoningStone.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Summoning_Stone","pinyin":"zhaohuanshi","initials":"zhs"},{"id":"addon:blighted_corruption:vigo_s_journal","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-21","title":"威戈的日志","titleEn":"Vigo's Journal","rarity":"very-rare","description":["一个自称从虚空中回来的男人的日记。其中的知识具有实际应用价值。","· 横冲时获得无法侦测状态。","无法侦测状态会隐藏杀手的气场、恐惧范围与红光。"],"flavor":"“在一片满是遗忘梦境与无尽循环的废土中，有办法出去的人就是神。”——塔尔伯特·格莱姆斯","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_vigosJournal.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Vigo%27s_Journal","pinyin":"weigederizhi","initials":"wgdrz"},{"id":"addon:blighted_corruption:soul_chemical","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-21","title":"灵魂质","titleEn":"Soul 