on:blighted_corruption:plague_bile","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-21","title":"瘟疫胆汁","titleEn":"Plague Bile","rarity":"uncommon","description":["瘟疫的胆汁样品，经蒸馏并用化学混合物处理。","· 横冲转向速度增加10%。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_plagueBile.webp","glyph":0,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Plague_Bile","pinyin":"wenyidanzhi","initials":"wydz"},{"id":"addon:blighted_corruption:pustula_dust","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-21","title":"脓疱粉尘","titleEn":"Pustula Dust","rarity":"uncommon","description":["磨成细粉尘的干脓疱花瓣。","· 直撞持续时间增加0.75秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_pustulaDust.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Pustula_Dust","pinyin":"nongpaofenchen","initials":"npfc"},{"id":"addon:blighted_corruption:compound_seven","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-21","title":"7号化合物","titleEn":"Compound Seven","rarity":"common","description":["这件早期样品未能获得理想的结果，但仍然显示出了令人惊讶的效果。","· 使用直撞后自动面向16米范围内最近的逃生者。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_compoundSeven.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Compound_Seven","pinyin":"7haohuahewu","initials":"7hhhw"},{"id":"addon:blighted_corruption:placebo_tablet","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-21","title":"安慰剂药片","titleEn":"Placebo Tablet","rarity":"common","description":["完全没有效果的药片……果真如此吗？","·横冲移动速度减少15%。","·横冲得分事件获得100%额外血点。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_placeboTablet.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Placebo_Tablet","pinyin":"anweijiyaopian","initials":"awjyp"},{"id":"addon:blighted_corruption:foxglove","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-21","title":"毛地黄","titleEn":"Foxglove","rarity":"common","description":["让塔尔伯特对化学产生兴趣的某种毒性植物。它能唤起某些深藏的记忆。","· 横冲后的恢复时间减少0.25秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_foxglove.webp","glyph":7,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Foxglove","pinyin":"maodihuang","initials":"mdh"},{"id":"addon:blighted_corruption:chipped_monocle","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-